          {
            "details": "LTX-2.5 BF16 is the current fidelity baseline and its fixed FP8-cast sequential-offload variant is the current lower-memory canary. Runtime, artifacts, build context, topology, interfaces, validation, and provenance are unchanged.",
            "kind": "metadata",
            "references": [
              "https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2/tree/dfcc2108383fe1aaa0584bdf55d368a4bdadd90c",
